      "text": "Montelukast for allergic rhinitis:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " once daily (seasonal from 2 years, perennial from 6 months); 15 years and older one 10-mg tablet. Reserve for an inadequate response to or intolerance of other therapies (neuropsychiatric risk)."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
